{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, and concat fusion in a multiprofile setting. The validation accuracy of 0.6878 exceeds the current RNA-only best (0.653), suggesting multimodal fusion may improve performance. However, the exact contribution of individual components (e.g., image data, fusion method) remains uncertain due to potential confounding factors."
}

